 "notes": [
  "A_p and B_s are the derivatives with respect to a compressive stress of (W_par - W_perp)/W_par for the P waves and of (W_S1 - W_S2)/W_S1 for the S waves across the stress, W being the natural velocities (a reference length over a travel time). Recomputed so from the constants printed in the same row, they agree with the printed values to the printed digits for 21 of the 23 rows. For Juvite the printed A_p (-2580.1) is not that of its printed constants (-3199); it would be with m = 7.5e6 GPa instead of the printed 9.3e6. For Rischorrite the printed A_p (2257.90) has the magnitude of the recomputed value and the opposite sign. The values are kept as printed."
 ]
